<title>JAPAN: Mizuno says will boost capital of its U.S. unit.</title>
<headline>Mizuno says will boost capital of its U.S. unit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mizuno Corp, a major manufacturer of sporting goods, announced on Monday that it plans to boost the capital of Mizuno USA Inc, a wholly owned U.S. subsidiary.</p>
<p>The capital of the Georgia-based unit will be raised on Tuesday to $50 million from the current $1 million, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
